"""Regenerate cpython312_json_parity.json: CPython 3.12's json.loads on malformed input.

Run it with the pinned interpreter, from anywhere:

    /opt/homebrew/bin/python3.12 -I tools/release-scope/testdata/gen_cpython312_json_parity.py [OUT]

OUT defaults to cpython312_json_parity.json next to this script. The script refuses
to run on any interpreter that is not CPython 3.12, and prints the version it found.
Inputs are built from printable ASCII runs, BS (a backslash) and chr(n), so no
escape sequence in this file can be misread. Expected results are whatever this
CPython 3.12 raises; the fixture is the record of that, not a hand-written guess.
"""

